   "body": "### Update: #372 now at `35337c9` (CodeRabbit round)\nExtra checks:\n- [ ] Duo portrait: open an MP, show the list (system button), delete that MP. The detail empties and **the list stays visible**.\n- [ ] Duo portrait: topic open in Favoris → Messages → back to Favoris. The topic is shown at full width.\n- [ ] iPad: Split View resize regular → compact → regular. The current topic comes back. The other destinations' selections are reset (intended, documented in HFR-006).\n- [ ] iPad window in compact height (Stage Manager, if reachable): the quick-reply button stays.\n- [ ] VoiceOver: « Actualiser », « Nouveau sujet », « Afficher/Masquer les catégories » are announced on the toolbar buttons.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_",
